    <string name="setup_1_title">What this does</string>
    <string name="setup_1_body">This add-on puts an “Open in Stremio” button on your movies and episodes in SeriesGuide. Tap it, and Stremio opens on that exact title. It opens Fireguy the same way if you have it.</string>
    <string name="setup_2_title">Turn it on in SeriesGuide</string>
    <string name="setup_2_body">The button only appears after you switch the extension on inside SeriesGuide. Open Extensions and enable “Open in Stremio”.</string>
    <string name="setup_3_title">Make sure a player is installed</string>
    <string name="setup_3_body">The button opens Stremio, so grab it if it isn’t on your device yet — it’s free. Fireguy works too if you have it sideloaded, and with both installed the button asks which one you want.</string>
    <string name="setup_4_title">You’re all set</string>
    <string name="setup_4_body">That’s it. Open any movie or episode in SeriesGuide and look for the “Open in…” button.</string>
